                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d0a2bc83-4338-30ad-bdf5-8e9cf3a090c0",
                        "entry_id": "74020469-6db9-3e47-808c-51cd9d5b0adb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "w sposób serdeczny, z uprzejmością, życzliwością; otwarcie"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d75622d-5409-48f7-8b44-ca1dd5263b46",
                                "sense_id": "d0a2bc83-4338-30ad-bdf5-8e9cf3a090c0",
                                "text": "Ile miłości potrafiłeś wbudować w twój dom rodzinny? Jest w nim ciepło, miło, przytulnie, wyrozumiale, serdecznie, wybaczająco, przepraszająco, tkliwie, wrażliwie?"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "274d738e-0708-3548-874c-96723029fd32",
                        "entry_id": "74020469-6db9-3e47-808c-51cd9d5b0adb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "naprawdę, całkowicie, bardzo"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "37c35e66-bdc0-4e3e-bbaa-062a4de5ba9f",
                                "sense_id": "274d738e-0708-3548-874c-96723029fd32",
                                "text": "Nareszcie, ponieważ oznaczało to koniec wielomiesięcznych przygotowań, których miałem już serdecznie dość i nad którymi od kilku dni już nie panowałem"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fdba038d-ad5b-4cf0-b2c7-a1ca9c7f3e4e",
                        "source_entry_id": "74020469-6db9-3e47-808c-51cd9d5b0adb",
                        "source_sense_id": "d0a2bc83-4338-30ad-bdf5-8e9cf3a090c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "cordially",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cordially",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28f6b2d8-b9d1-3f19-9ab8-f780227024a9",
                                        "entry_id": "43e44d20-b664-3bbc-adca-5c831399cda9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a cordial, warm, friendly or heartfelt manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b5b197b-76b5-4e6b-b342-f5c9a7549a34",
                                                "sense_id": "28f6b2d8-b9d1-3f19-9ab8-f780227024a9",
                                                "text": "I may ask you, then, cordially to thank Sir George Goldie for all that he has done for the Society."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "704b7eb2-8e49-4a6e-b231-a6e6c9b6b953",
                                                "sense_id": "28f6b2d8-b9d1-3f19-9ab8-f780227024a9",
                                                "text": "Ever most cordially yours,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5852105f-436b-4a83-a4ed-1602152011ad",
                                                "sense_id": "28f6b2d8-b9d1-3f19-9ab8-f780227024a9",
                                                "text": "In the thick of the railway controversies of his day, Francis naturally had his prejudices. It seems that he cordially disliked the aristocracy in general."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1071968-57e4-4bc3-9636-b6e9ebff3da8",
                                                "sense_id": "28f6b2d8-b9d1-3f19-9ab8-f780227024a9",
                                                "text": "A rail tour on Sunday, March 12, in which non-members are cordially invited to participate, will leave St. Pancras at approximately 2 p.m. [...]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b7a4beb8-f479-4801-966b-bb5ad8bb4f15",
                        "source_entry_id": "74020469-6db9-3e47-808c-51cd9d5b0adb",
                        "source_sense_id": "d0a2bc83-4338-30ad-bdf5-8e9cf3a090c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "heartily",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heartily",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3eb7487-ed9e-30d5-9094-0abf13d59373",
                                        "entry_id": "eb9f6013-30c7-3197-a873-718e307982f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a hearty manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d049dea-f658-498e-83c1-866fcc0a3183",
                                                "sense_id": "a3eb7487-ed9e-30d5-9094-0abf13d59373",
                                                "text": "eat heartily"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0177198-a5cb-4c7f-8653-a01bebbcfe79",
                                                "sense_id": "a3eb7487-ed9e-30d5-9094-0abf13d59373",
                                                "text": "greet someone heartily"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e67a8678-04fd-4e3c-bc88-3bb07542fe3b",
                                                "sense_id": "a3eb7487-ed9e-30d5-9094-0abf13d59373",
                                                "text": "Sometimes he laughed heartily as if he heard some capital joke; by degrees this lessened, and he spoke rapidly, but in very low tones."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6a841e3e-8adf-414e-a75f-a89652e9ad30",
                        "source_entry_id": "74020469-6db9-3e47-808c-51cd9d5b0adb",
                        "source_sense_id": "d0a2bc83-4338-30ad-bdf5-8e9cf3a090c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "warmly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "warmly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "30c5b1e8-c480-3dc9-967a-8def5137afcb",
                                        "entry_id": "81ff6b7a-41c1-3d71-863f-90db8dd95f99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a manner that maintains warm temperature."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b8aab83-75db-42fe-b835-3447ba267374",
                                                "sense_id": "30c5b1e8-c480-3dc9-967a-8def5137afcb",
                                                "text": "Be sure to dress warmly today!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9adaae0d-2df5-4be3-b1b5-734179927e43",
                                                "sense_id": "30c5b1e8-c480-3dc9-967a-8def5137afcb",
                                                "text": "When praying in winter — and the winter in Regensburg was very cold — one should not shorten the prayers. He who is not warmly dressed, should go home."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "881e9280-5863-357a-9776-8c68f943fd68",
                                        "entry_id": "81ff6b7a-41c1-3d71-863f-90db8dd95f99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a warm, friendly manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b906aba-7a73-417f-91e6-26935379a87a",
                                                "sense_id": "881e9280-5863-357a-9776-8c68f943fd68",
                                                "text": "I said so - I said so warmly, for I felt that the Professor was an ill-used man."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8fd42796-4c66-3429-82a1-2c0d168d729e",
                                        "entry_id": "81ff6b7a-41c1-3d71-863f-90db8dd95f99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "With emotion, especially some anger; somewhat hotly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03b1fa02-926e-45a8-abda-c36ec2a4d46f",
                                                "sense_id": "8fd42796-4c66-3429-82a1-2c0d168d729e",
                                                "text": "One evening in particular, about a week after Colonel Brandon left the country, his heart seemed more than usually open to every feeling of attachment to the objects around him; and on Mrs. Dashwood’s happening to mention her design of improving the cottage in the spring, he warmly opposed every alteration of a place which affection had established as perfect with him. “What!” he exclaimed⁠—“improve this dear cottage! No. That I will never consent to. Not a stone must be added to its walls, not an inch to its size, if my feelings are regarded.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a6fb25b-73db-431e-bee8-fb21ecb6f29b",
                                                "sense_id": "8fd42796-4c66-3429-82a1-2c0d168d729e",
                                                "text": "Elinor then ventured to doubt the propriety of her receiving such a present from a man so little, or at least so lately known to her. This was too much. “You are mistaken, Elinor,” said she warmly, “in supposing I know very little of Willoughby.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3a231a7d-28be-4708-8b31-5d684a3b5cbf",
                        "source_entry_id": "74020469-6db9-3e47-808c-51cd9d5b0adb",
                        "source_sense_id": "d0a2bc83-4338-30ad-bdf5-8e9cf3a090c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "herzlich",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "herzlich",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab1ca000-6055-3bb8-b900-a1c90f7b5bc7",
                                        "entry_id": "e6c52fc0-0e1a-3391-ae2f-80597d727dee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "freundlich gesinnt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ec705a7-5eb8-461f-a24b-ae0a8b62c597",
                                                "sense_id": "ab1ca000-6055-3bb8-b900-a1c90f7b5bc7",
                                                "text": "Sie wurde am Bahnhof von der Tante herzlich empfangen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "764f2cc8-9bec-4019-8697-e68a6195fa7a",
                                                "sense_id": "ab1ca000-6055-3bb8-b900-a1c90f7b5bc7",
                                                "text": "Er wünschte ihr herzliche Glückwünsche zum Geburtstag."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22f4acf6-2a01-4adb-a123-fe4fbc6f4dbd",
                                                "sense_id": "ab1ca000-6055-3bb8-b900-a1c90f7b5bc7",
                                                "text": "„Freddie begrüßte seinen Bruder mit einer herzlichen Umarmung.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d708938-9e55-35c8-b8e7-edacdbf8de9c",
                                        "entry_id": "e6c52fc0-0e1a-3391-ae2f-80597d727dee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ziemlich, sehr"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "verstärkend",
                                            "bei Adjektiven und Verben"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b77a4663-9dfe-44bb-bb22-e6805cf3da4b",
                                                "sense_id": "3d708938-9e55-35c8-b8e7-edacdbf8de9c",
                                                "text": "Der Schüler wusste bei der Prüfung herzlich wenig vom Lehrstoff."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6de4dbb-e58c-4255-9b5e-db423124f50f",
                                                "sense_id": "3d708938-9e55-35c8-b8e7-edacdbf8de9c",
                                                "text": "Das tut mir aber herzlich leid."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7a22175-247f-4251-8c9b-c7892edcdc4d",
                                                "sense_id": "3d708938-9e55-35c8-b8e7-edacdbf8de9c",
                                                "text": "„Den Schweden ist das EuGH-Urteil zur Arbeitszeiterfassung herzlich egal. Denn sie machen schon heute kaum Überstunden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f3b34ee0-64f5-4e08-a362-fc5d349dce0b",
                        "source_entry_id": "74020469-6db9-3e47-808c-51cd9d5b0adb",
                        "source_sense_id": "d0a2bc83-4338-30ad-bdf5-8e9cf3a090c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "warm",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "warm",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66c6b3f5-5692-3b49-b0c0-365973371937",
                                        "entry_id": "b2d89b5b-50a2-30ca-91f5-5e6a058b8559",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "von hoher Temperatur (zwischen lau und heiß)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "824a1bd1-30ef-4805-a1da-81bd0f902eab",
                                                "sense_id": "66c6b3f5-5692-3b49-b0c0-365973371937",
                                                "text": "Der Sommer war recht warm."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b74b652-9dd4-4cef-803e-f67649ab0f07",
                                                "sense_id": "66c6b3f5-5692-3b49-b0c0-365973371937",
                                                "text": "„Damit etwas wärmer wird, muss man Energie zuführen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b60a008-b0ee-41b7-8f70-17771a4a6da3",
                                                "sense_id": "66c6b3f5-5692-3b49-b0c0-365973371937",
                                                "text": "„Hafer und Gerste ließen sich als widerstandsfähige Sorten überall anbauen, während Weizen und Spelt im wärmeren Süden und Westen besser gediehen als im Norden und Osten, wo der Roggenanbau dominierte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66acac78-912e-41c4-907d-727085d4c714",
                                                "sense_id": "66c6b3f5-5692-3b49-b0c0-365973371937",
                                                "text": "„Da die Erde wärmer wird, schmelzen zudem die Gletscher in den Hochgebirgen sowie die Eiskappen auf Grönland und zum Teil in der Antarktis.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef8a0453-733c-44b0-afa4-db89d8dfebb8",
                                                "sense_id": "66c6b3f5-5692-3b49-b0c0-365973371937",
                                                "text": "„So ist es seit 1881 in Hamburg etwa 1,7 °C wärmer geworden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bbb70fa-6015-36a9-b594-3b426fbc5a78",
                                        "entry_id": "b2d89b5b-50a2-30ca-91f5-5e6a058b8559",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "homosexuell"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figurative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47c11646-48bb-4f10-a008-0f3e7fc5dd8c",
                                                "sense_id": "5bbb70fa-6015-36a9-b594-3b426fbc5a78",
                                                "text": "Er ist sicher ein warmer Bruder."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71b44fc8-0d5a-3dd0-80bd-0378566b1638",
                                        "entry_id": "b2d89b5b-50a2-30ca-91f5-5e6a058b8559",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "einschließlich der monatlichen Abschlagszahlungen für alle Betriebskosten, also auch der Heizkosten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "von Mietpreisen"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7dbf8586-d973-4e12-a6be-02aeb942e5ff",
                                                "sense_id": "71b44fc8-0d5a-3dd0-80bd-0378566b1638",
                                                "text": "Die Wohnung kostet 550 Euro warm."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "da6dea6d-31bd-42e6-9e15-1d74169f5043",
                        "source_entry_id": "74020469-6db9-3e47-808c-51cd9d5b0adb",
